{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgkxZv4R2sz6tEU3iTPg8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"**Answer:** It's כלל, at 0.48% a year. מנורה מבטחים is right behind at 0.49%, and the most expensive is מור at 0.7%. I'm fairly sure. What decided it was the line under the filters: \"דמי ניהול מהחיסכון: מ־0.48% עד 0.7%\". כלל's row at the bottom shows 0.48%, so it matched. They're also a big name I know, so I'm fine with them.\n\n**How it went:**\n- **Screen 1:** It opened already set to \"קרן השתלמות 154\" and \"עוקב מדד S&P 500 12\", so the filter was done for me. I read the line \"12 מסלולים של 12 חברות… מ־0.48% עד 0.7%\". Then I went down the fee column. At first I thought the cheapest was at the top. The line underneath says \"מהיקר לזול\", meaning most expensive first, so the cheapest is at the bottom. That annoyed me a bit, since the cheapest should be first.\n- **Screen 2:** At the bottom are כלל 0.48% and then איילון with \"עוד לא דווח\" plus an orange warning sign and a \"חדש\" tag. I skipped איילון. It has no fee, it's new, and its circle shows only 40% stocks, which doesn't look like an S&P fund to me. It scared me off.\n- **What I skipped:** The returns column, the money-managed column, the 3- and 5-year figures, the stock and foreign-currency percentages, the small text at the bottom, \"חוקים וכללים\", and the footer.\n\n**What I wasn't sure about:**\n- \"אין מההפקדות\": I guessed it means they take no fee from the monthly deposits.\n- The number next to each company's name with the little icon (9451, 13342 and so on). I don't know what it is, maybe a fund number.\n- In אנליסט's row, \"101%\" stocks. How do you get more than 100%?\n- The top row: \"123 ממקור / 123 מחושב / 123 הזנתה\". No idea what that is.\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- The order is most expensive to cheapest, so the answer is at the bottom.\n- In איילון's row, the fee is missing and there's a warning sign.\n- I haven't actually done anything yet. The page doesn't say how to switch funds."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1477,"cache_read_input_tokens":7888,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1477},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ac14c71d-b742-4acf-843c-2101906c1bad","uuid":"12fd5276-8c57-42d7-a9d5-d498dae0b499","timestamp":"2026-11-06T03:24:18.107Z","request_id":"req_011CgkxZurH4WDCf539iZn6B"}
